id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix for GSI
version=v12
versionCode=12
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Universal fix for broken traffic indicator on Android GSIs. (1) BPF repair via kver_override + bpfloader restart, (2) Native binder proxy (v4.0) reading /proc/net/dev directly with fixed flat_binder_object for protocol v8, (3) Comprehensive SELinux policy with netstats_service targeting, (4) Stub bpfloader detection, (5) Watchdog monitoring. Handles system, system_axion, system_infinity variants.
